{"data":[{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114907435496251767"],"id":"2114907435496251767","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3804,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":3},"text":"【中企承建科威特規模最大的污水處理項目開工】由中國企業承建的當前科威特規模最大的污水處理項目——北卡巴德污水處理廠及配套項目26日在科威特舉行開工儀式。項目占地約280萬平方米，污水處理廠初始日處理能力為50萬立方米，未來可擴展至100萬立方米。北卡巴德污水處理廠及配套項目是中科高質量共建“ https://t.co/rjUcJ5SHeQ","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114907435496251767"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:23:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114905815647949202"],"id":"2114905815647949202","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":14065,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":82,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114882903738122427","type":"quoted"}],"text":"金正恩问：你们习主席为什么总是模仿我？王毅妙回： https://t.co/fMJm4mIcaZ https://t.co/fKtg8KCibo","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2114905815647949202"},{"author_id":"1737484177413492737","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:17:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904212337484212"],"id":"2114904212337484212","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1444,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"变强只有一种方式\n就是持续做事\n持续解决问题\n持续设立新的目标\n加油 LOYAL https://t.co/rnqPF4BR7s","url":"https://x.com/LoyalSiman/status/2114904212337484212"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114899892095328549"],"id":"2114899892095328549","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5836,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":9},"text":"【前三季度全國PM2.5平均濃度同比下降3.9%】生態環境部26日公布的數據顯示，2026年前三季度，全國339個地級及以上城市PM2.5平均濃度為24.9微克/立方米，同比下降3.9%；PM10平均濃度為42微克/立方米，同比下降6.7%；平均空氣質量優良天數比例為86.6%，同比上升2.8個百分點。 https://t.co/gkhl7sLeuk","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114899892095328549"},{"author_id":"50683","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:53:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114898290521297144"],"id":"2114898290521297144","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6240,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":2},"text":"现在很多人都用 bot 或自己搭一个网站实时监控所谓的爆款，然后二次洗稿。Twitter 的屏蔽功能就是个摆设，屏蔽了也能看，应该推出屏蔽 agent 的功能啊！\n\n反正我一直都是随缘发，那天随手发了一条也没什么长篇大论的废话，竟然 350 万流量。。。当你想好好发的信息通常没人看。","url":"https://x.com/dingyi/status/2114898290521297144"},{"author_id":"1938963008","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:53:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114898205334962665"],"id":"2114898205334962665","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2772,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"It doesn't get any better than this.☕ https://t.co/shAWAYbJ6l","url":"https://x.com/HotmailfromSH/status/2114898205334962665"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:39:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114894695008715013"],"id":"2114894695008715013","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":78,"impression_count":18020,"like_count":208,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":24},"text":"有人问我，为什么很多公司最后留下的都是能力一般的人，而真正厉害的人却不断离开？因为公司的目标，从来不是聚集最优秀的人，而是建立一个能够稳定运转、持续创造利润的组织。个人能力强，不代表组织价值高。能力越强的人，往往要求越高、选择越多，管理和协作成本也可能越高。相反，能力普通但值得信","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114894695008715013"},{"author_id":"1456122926432862223","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:36:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114893938406617367"],"id":"2114893938406617367","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":11185,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114892274173628728","type":"quoted"}],"text":"最多不超过2030年，短线选手可能大部分要被AI取代\n\n在这个过程中，会有一个时期是AI用得好的，可以赚到不用AI人的钱\n\n尤其是在股票交易中，大部分投资者还是不怎么会用AI工具的老登\n\n现在股票上链了，传统老登们准备好迎接P小将们的骑脸输出吧~ https://t.co/CKLsDq22m1 https://t.co/HZL4BvdBP1","url":"https://x.com/giantcutie666/status/2114893938406617367"},{"author_id":"1166950087399837696","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:34:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114893535241720214"],"id":"2114893535241720214","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":7926,"like_count":37,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"国家统计局就这点儿好，守时，说几点发就几点发。\n\n1—9月份全国规模以上工业企业利润发布，增长15.5%。\n\n虽然较前几个月有所减缓，但是这个同比还是异常惊人的。\n\n表现优秀的：\n计算机、通信和其他电子设备制造业，+103.8%；\n有色金属冶炼和压延加工业，+79.7%；\n煤炭开采和洗选业，+57.0%； https://t.co/n2b2w17Pjj","url":"https://x.com/RobinSeun/status/2114893535241720214"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:30:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114892372186476730"],"id":"2114892372186476730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2799,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"纪念台湾光复81周年图片展在非洲多国举办\n连日来，在非洲莫桑比克首都马普托、尼日利亚首都阿布贾、坦桑尼亚达累斯萨拉姆、南非约翰内斯堡等地，各界人士前往参观纪念台湾光复81周年图片展。 https://t.co/FtYZ7bhI5s","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2114892372186476730"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114892336618750162"],"id":"2114892336618750162","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3914,"like_count":16,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":9},"text":"【2026年前三季度國內居民出遊人次53.07億】文化和旅遊部26日消息，根據國內居民出遊抽樣調查結果，2026年前三季度，中國國內居民出遊人次53.07億，比2025年同期增加3.09億，同比增長6.2%；國內居民出遊總花費4.95萬億元，比2025年同期增加0.11萬億元，同比增長2.2%。 https://t.co/WyNADUHWJc","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114892336618750162"},{"article":{"title":"AI交易初尝试"},"author_id":"1456122926432862223","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:29:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114892274173628728"],"id":"2114892274173628728","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":15852,"like_count":37,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"https://t.co/EXDlVlH9RQ","url":"https://x.com/giantcutie666/status/2114892274173628728"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:29:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114892258831184263"],"id":"2114892258831184263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":7196,"like_count":73,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":9},"text":"你知道吗？每次过生日许愿、还是你烧香拜佛。你的愿望一定要具体，不要模糊。因为许愿和拜佛的意义，不是期待某种外部力量替你实现愿望，而是借助这个仪式，让自己看清内心真正的追求。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114892258831184263"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:25:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114891284146172398"],"id":"2114891284146172398","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":9670,"like_count":144,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":18},"text":"父母是孩子来到这个世界的导游：是教导，而不是管制；是陪伴，而不是监视；是满足，而不是纵容；是托举，而不是包办；是保护，而不是控制；是启发，而不是灌输。我们不是要把孩子培养成自己期待的样子，而是帮助他逐渐拥有认识世界、理解自己、独立判断和承担责任的能力。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114891284146172398"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114889360256758222"],"id":"2114889360256758222","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":147,"impression_count":18185,"like_count":370,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":57},"text":"一个人最危险的状态，不是暂时失去能力，而是长期消耗之后，连改变现状的意愿都没有了。这个时候，继续逼迫自己努力，往往只会加深内耗。真正需要的，是暂时退出那些不断消耗自己的关系、评价和竞争，恢复身体的精力、精神的自主与思想的独立。睡觉、游戏、旅行、阅读，都只是手段，本质是让自己重新获","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114889360256758222"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:13:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114888083338617173"],"id":"2114888083338617173","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":171,"impression_count":16526,"like_count":348,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":49},"text":"这个世界真正的赚钱秘诀，不是运气，不是风水，更不是所谓的贵人相助，而是你的思想决定了你如何认识世界，认知决定了你的选择，选择塑造了你的行为，行为经过长期积累，最终形成你的命运。所谓运气变好，往往是因为你改变了关注的方向、思考的方式和行动的习惯，开始看见过去看不见的机会，接触过去接","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114888083338617173"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:09:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114887268687368310"],"id":"2114887268687368310","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":14359,"like_count":90,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":5},"text":"据研究，肌肉力量越弱，脑子越慢。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114887268687368310"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:01:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114885281283551618"],"id":"2114885281283551618","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3948,"like_count":11,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Vlog｜相逢广交会\n迎来创办70周年的第140届广交会正在广州举行，展会首期已迎来18.9万境外采购商参会。珠江之畔，晚风徐徐。广交会的采购商们走出展馆，告别一整天的奔波，围坐在夜色里闲谈。广交会，商机与相逢同在。戳视频，解锁采购商不一样的“下班”体验。 https://t.co/SlCPfDaFtQ","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2114885281283551618"},{"author_id":"855303666722525184","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:00:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114884813400477990"],"id":"2114884813400477990","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":4761,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":2},"text":"旅行中普通的一瞬间，改成插画就变得很珍贵！\n\n附提示词 https://t.co/eMs0dIRjPr","url":"https://x.com/wanerfu/status/2114884813400477990"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-27T01:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114884790768042453"],"id":"2114884790768042453","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3384,"like_count":21,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"【安徽蕪湖：甘浙特高壓長江大跨越完成架線】10月26日，“西電東送”重點工程——甘肅-浙江±800千伏特高壓直流輸電工程長江大跨越在蕪湖完成架線。甘浙特高壓工程起於甘肅省武威市，止於浙江省紹興市，全長約2370公里，投運後每年可向浙江輸送電量超360億千瓦時，其中一半以上是“綠電”。 https://t.co/aqjxYcXwJc","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114884790768042453"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:55:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114883627452703121"],"id":"2114883627452703121","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":11434,"like_count":116,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":3},"text":"你知道吗？我要是不能从你身上赚到钱，你就尽量不要私信我，看我的免费帖子就好。因为当你私信问我的时候，往往意味着我的帖子已经解决不了你的困惑，或者你希望得到更直接、更有针对性的解释。那你就需要订阅我，我才有动力花时间认真回答你。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114883627452703121"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1531801543","name":"人民日報  People's Daily","username":"PDChinese"},{"id":"55964567